# Intentionally empty.
#
# This application is configured from config/ defaults plus the environment mise or the container supplies,
# so it ships no .env. Laravel still looks for one on every boot, and with APP_ENV=testing it looks for this
# file first — its presence is what stops phpdotenv warning once per test that the file is missing.
#
# The test environment lives in phpunit.xml. Nothing belongs here.
